---
description: Evolve Prisma incrementally with safe phase-owned migrations.
globs: "{prisma/**,src/**/*.ts,specs/**/*.md}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Inspect the current schema and complete migration history first.
- Add only models and fields required by the active phase.
- Centralize Prisma models in `prisma/schema.prisma`.
- Create a clearly named phase-owned migration and review generated SQL.
- Document defaults, backfills, constraints, indexes, data risk, and forward-fix strategy.
- Never edit or delete an applied migration.
- Keep direct Prisma access inside the owning repository/infrastructure layer.
- Regenerate Prisma Client, validate the schema, test clean application, and run compatibility tests.
- Use decimal-safe financial types and preserve immutable/historical records.
